Package: DBEST
Type: Package
Title: Detecting Breakpoints and Estimating Segments in Trend
Version: 1.9
Date: 2026-10-20
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sadegh", "Jamali", email = "sadegh.jamali@tft.lth.se",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Hristo", "Tomov", role = "aut"))
Description: Analyzes vegetation time series using two algorithms. The change
    detection algorithm identifies trend changes, classifies them as abrupt or
    gradual, and estimates their timing, magnitude, number, and direction. Users
    can specify the number of major breakpoints or the magnitude threshold for
    changes of interest. The trend generalization algorithm simplifies the time
    series to its main features. Users can adjust this process with a
    generalization-percentage parameter. The methods are described in Jamali et
    al. (2015) <doi:10.1016/j.rse.2014.09.010>.
